ass=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 各框架的适用场景\n\n<span class=\"token title important\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">##</span> 工程实践</span>\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 生产级 Agent 设计（状态机、容错、降级）\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] Prompt 工程技巧\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 模型选型策略\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 性能优化方法\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h3 data-heading=\"代码准备\" dir=\"auto\">代码准备</h3>\n<pre class=\"language-markdown\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-markdown is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 能手写 ReAct Agent 核心逻辑\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 能写 RAG 流程代码\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 熟悉 LangChain 基本用法\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 能手画系统架构图\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx