rmal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 公司主要产品/服务\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 公司在 AI/Agent 方面的布局\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 技术栈（从招聘 JD 和开源项目推断）\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 竞品对比\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 最新新闻和动态\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 公司文化和价值观\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"四、材料准备\" dir=\"auto\">四、材料准备</h2>\n<pre class=\"language-markdown\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-markdown is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 简历打印件（2-3份）\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 身份证\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 学历证书/证明\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 作品集/项目 Demo（如有）\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] GitHub 主页整理好\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 笔记本和笔\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"五、技术环境准备（线上面试）\" dir=\"auto\">五、技术环境准备（线上面试）</h2>\n<pre class=\"language-markdown\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-markdown is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 网络稳定（有线网络优先）\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 摄像头和麦克风测试\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 开发环境就绪（IDE、Python环境）\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 白板/纸笔（画架构图用）\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 安静的环境\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 备用设备（防止意外）\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"六、心态调整\" dir=\"auto\">六、心态调整</h2>\n<pre class=\"language-markdown\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-markdown is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 充足睡眠（面试前一晚）\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 提前到达（线下提前30分钟，线上提前10分钟）\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 深呼吸放松\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 积极的心理暗示\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 准备好自我介绍（熟练但不背诵）\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 预设可能的问题并准备答案\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"七、常见面试题预演\" dir=\"auto\">七、常见面试题预演</h2>\n<pre class=\"language-markdown\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-markdown is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token title important\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">##</span> 基础题</span>\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 什么是 Agent？和 LLM 的区别？\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] ReAct 框架的原理？\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] CoT 和 ToT 的区别？\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] RAG 的完整流程？\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] Function Calling 的流程？\n\n<span class=\"token title important\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">##</span> 进阶题</span>\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 如何设计一个生产级 Agent？\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 如何处理 Agent 的幻觉问题？\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 多 Agent 系统的协作模式？\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] MCP 和 Function Calling 的关系？\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] RAG 的优化策略有哪些？\n\n<span class=\"token title important\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">##</span> 开放题</span>\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 设计一个客服 Agent 系统\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 如何评估 Agent 的效果？\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] Agent 的安全问题如何处理？\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"八、面试当天流程\" dir=\"auto\">八、面试当天流程</h2>\n<pre class=\"language-markdown\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-markdown is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token title important\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">##</span> 面试前 1 小时</span>\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 检查设备和网络（线上面试）\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 查看交通路线（线下面试）\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 复习自我介绍\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 调整心态\n\n<span class=\"token title important\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">##</span> 面试中</span>\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 保持微笑和眼神交流\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 听清问题再回答\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 结构化表达\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 不懂就诚实说不懂\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 适当展示思考过程\n\n<span class=\"token title important\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">##</span> 面试后</span>\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 24 小时内发送感谢邮件/消息\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 复盘面试表现\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 记录面试官的问题和反馈\n<span class=\"token list punctuation\">-</span> [ ] 等待结果的同时继续准备其他面试\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"九、相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">九、相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/03-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E6%94%BB%E7%95%A5/%E8%87%AA%E6%88%91%E4%BB%8B%E7%BB%8D%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/03-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E6%94%BB%E7%95%A5/%E8%87%AA%E6%88%91%E4%BB%8B%E7%BB%8D%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">自我介绍模板</a> — 自我介绍准备</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%